Neon spaces (M2), part 4 of 5: strip filter.

The vertical tab strip shows only the visible space's tabs, pinned and
unpinned: hidden tabs are left out of the layouts like tabs outside a focused
group, and the containers lay out again when the active tab moves to another
space. Other layouts are unaffected (spaces are off there).

